|             5.10.275  -  kernel only, nothing else touched               |
+==========================================================================+
|                                                                          |
|  WHAT THIS IS                                                            |
|    Linux 5.10.275, merged from Google's android12-5.10-lts on the        |
|    23rd, not a relabelled 274. Same code the phone's vendor modules      |
|    were built against.                                                   |
|                                                                          |
|  WHAT IT DOES FOR YOU                                                    |
|    memory    stock multi-LRU - the one that does not freeze this SoC     |
|              (MGLRU is compiled but OFF: every walk-enabled build,       |
|               including FleurX's, froze at the PIN. Turn it on with      |
|               echo 1 > /sys/kernel/mm/lru_gen/enabled if you are         |
|               curious; do not enable the walks.)                        |
|    idle      AEGIS governor compiled in - energy-ledger deep idle,       |
|              selected by /data/adb/service.d/03-cpuidle-aegis.sh         |
|    scheduler EAS capacity-inversion detection + bounded LLC idle scan    |
|    power     workqueue power-efficient, RCU lazy callbacks, DAMON,       |
|              300 Hz tick, INIT_ON_ALLOC off, KSM off                     |
|    security  thin LTO + CFI, CFI check skipped as the stock kernel does  |
|    root      KernelSU-Next + SUSFS, built in, no modules required        |
|                                                                          |
|  WHAT IT DOES NOT DO                                                     |
|    It does not replace your ramdisk, your dtbo or your vendor modules.   |
|    It writes one Image into boot and leaves everything else alone, so    |
|    the ROM's own camera, display and modem drivers keep working.         |
|    It does not hide thermals, force a governor, or tweak sysctls.        |
|                                                                          |
|  AFTER BOOT                                                              |
|    uname -r                                 5.10.275-Unbothered/...      |
|    cat /sys/kernel/mm/lru_gen/enabled        0x0000  (off, on purpose)   |
|    cat /sys/devices/system/cpu/cpuidle/current_governor                  |
|                                                                          |
|  ROLLBACK                                                                |
|    flash the previous zip, or fastboot flash boot <backup>.img           |
|                                                                          |
